; Verdict 8388607:
;   1      the breath is thirty minutes
;   2      even and clean is clear — nothing to land this breath
;   4      ahead and clean and water pushes
;   8      behind and clean and water rebases then pushes
;   16     diverge and clean and water rebases then pushes
;   32     ahead and clean and quiet water waits
;   64     a conflict keeps both meanings and continues
;   128    unexplained dirt stays unstaged
;   256    force-push stays closed
;   512    the seat is a sibling, not a bus
;   1024   due at thirty, quiet at twenty-nine
;   2048   push is host git: local with water, silence without
;   4096   related dirt commits, then lands
;   8192   repeating a clear picture stays quiet in the chat
;   16384  a red drift gate lands nothing: push, rebase-push, commit-land become gate-refused
;   32768  a green gate lets a land through; a red gate leaves clear and hold untouched
;   65536  a reading is the lens's trailing field code: the last non-blank line, blank tail shed
;   131072 moved and steady are read against the planted previous breath (and the line names what it moved from)
;   262144 no previous reading - no memory at all, or no line for this lens - is a first reading
;   524288 a lens that answers nothing, no number, or its own 0 reads unobserved, said once; the memory keeps the last reading
;   1048576 readings never gate: rows speaking every word sit beside the landing act and the act is the gate's alone
;   2097152 the fourth lens is the forbidden-tools audit (observe/forbidden-tools-audit-run.bml), and a line of a lens's words that
